        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 1, SJ 1",
        "text": "Casey Mittelstadt scored at 3:08, assisted by James Hagens and Elias Lindholm. Michael Misa tied it 1–1 on a San Jose power play at 5:54."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "BOS 2, SJ 2",
        "text": "Marat Khusnutdinov, who signed a three-year extension on Wednesday, put Boston ahead 2–1 at 8:20 off a Fraser Minten setup. Kiefer Sherwood answered short-handed at 13:34, intercepting a Lindholm pass and skating in alone to tie it 2–2."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: BOS 6, SJ 4",
        "text": "Dmitry Orlov's power-play goal at 4:03 gave San Jose a 3–2 lead. Fresh out of the penalty box, David Pastrnak tied it 3–3 at 8:27 on a 3-on-2 with JJ Peterka, his 427th career goal, tying Patrice Bergeron for third in Bruins history. Hagens scored from the net-front less than a minute later for a 4–3 lead, and Minten's power-play goal at 12:00 made it 5–3. Will Smith answered 27 seconds later at 4-on-4, and Will Borgen sealed it with an empty-netter at 19:32."
      }
    ],
